This is not so much a question about the code itself but rather behind the logic of it
Consider this tutorial I worked from
class person { 
    var $name; 
    function set_name($new_name) { 
        $this->name = $new_name;
    } 
    function get_name() { 
        return $this->name 
    } 
} 

